            <div xml:id="d103">

                <pb facs="0145" n="133" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg133"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.01/2188: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Algiers</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Wiley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-06-03T19:00:00-04:00">June 3, 1943—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1065. For Murphy. Your 1012, June 1, 6 p.m. The decision of this Government on
                    the position it will take toward any French administration to be created must
                    await conclusion of present conversations in Algiers since the results of those
                    conversations so far indicate uncertainty as to future course of the French.</p>
                <p>With regard to possible adherence of the French to United Nations Declaration,
                    the above considerations also apply and furthermore in order to avoid
                    embarrassment there should be no French communication requesting adherence to
                    United Nations Declaration unless a decision is reached in advance by this
                    Government, in consultation with certain other United Nations, to accept French
                    adherence. For your information such consultation is customary before acceptance
                    of adherence.</p>
                <p>The views contained in your 1012 are appreciated and you will of course report
                    developments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
